x13-rs is an independent Rust translation of X-13ARIMA-SEATS Version 1.1
Build 62 from the U.S. Census Bureau. It is not produced, endorsed or
supported by the Census Bureau or the U.S. Department of Commerce. This
repository contains no Census Fortran source; its Nix flake builds Build 62
from the official Census archive, changing only one link line in the archive's
makefile.


