MINPACK
-------

src/numerics/minpack.rs, src/numerics/build62.rs and src/arima/covariance.rs
translate lmdif, fdjac2, lmpar, qrfac, qrsolv, covar, enorm and dpmpar from
MINPACK as included in X-13ARIMA-SEATS.

