LINPACK and reference BLAS
--------------------------

src/numerics/packed.rs translates the LINPACK routines dppfa, dppsl and dppdi
(Dongarra, Bunch, Moler and Stewart, LINPACK Users' Guide, SIAM, 1979) and
the reference BLAS routine dscal, and src/numerics/blas1.rs translates the
reference BLAS routines daxpy and ddot, all as included in X-13ARIMA-SEATS. Both packages are distributed
freely through Netlib.


Test corpus
-----------

The series in tests/parity/series/ were retrieved from FRED, Federal Reserve
Bank of St. Louis. Each is published by a U.S. federal agency, named per
series in tests/parity/series.toml, and is in the public domain.
